flowchart TD
  Base[Immutable base and matching interner] --> Update[Checked leaf updates]
  Update --> Symbols[Shared typed symbol traversal]
  Symbols --> Dense[Keep reachable strings and remap all references]
  Dense --> Next[Current graph with stable DeclIds]
  Dense --> Cache[Refresh symbolic path layout and reuse hashes]
  Next --> CBOR[Existing canonical CBOR boundary]
  CBOR --> Symbols
  Base --> Old[Explicit old readers stay valid]
